      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"row g-5\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid\"\n                                src=\"/img/about-1.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Contemporary open-plan kitchen with pendant lighting designed by The Omega Group\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid h-75\"\n                                src=\"/img/about-2.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Warm, timber-accented living space crafted by The Omega Group\">\n                            <div class=\"h-25 d-flex align-items-center text-center bg-primary px-4 about-badge\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-white lh-base mb-0 about-badge-title\">10+ Years of Design Excellence</h4>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\"><span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Our</span> Story</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">The Omega Group was founded on a simple belief: a home or workplace should feel\n                        as considered as it looks. What began as a small design practice has grown into a full\n                        turnkey interior studio, trusted by luxury homeowners, villa and apartment owners, architects,\n                        builders, and businesses who want one accountable partner from first sketch to final key\n                        handover.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-5\">Our design philosophy is deliberately unhurried. We spend real time understanding\n                        how a space will be lived in before a single drawing is finalised, then apply the same\n                        discipline to material selection, on-site execution, and quality control — so the finished\n                        space matches the vision, down to the last detail.</p>\n                    <div class=\"row g-3\">\n                        <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-3\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Personalised Design Process\n                            </h6>\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>In-House Design Team</h6>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-3\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>End-to-End Turnkey Delivery\n                            </h6>\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Uncompromising Quality\n                                Standards</h6>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center mt-5\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-primary px-4 me-2\" href=\"/contact.html\" data-cta=\"book-appointment\">Book Consultation</a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2 me-2\"\n                            href=\"https://www.facebook.com/theomegainteriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"The Omega Group on Facebook\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2 me-2\"\n                            href=\"https://www.instagram.com/theomegainteriors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"The Omega Group on Instagram\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2\"\n                            href=\"https://wa.me/919811001900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"Chat with The Omega Group on WhatsApp\"><i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">Why Clients <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Choose\n                        Us</span></h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row g-4 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-calendar-alt fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>10+ Years of Experience</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Over a decade and a half designing and delivering homes, offices, and\n                            commercial interiors across residential and business segments.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-user-tie fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Dedicated Design Lead</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Every project is guided by one dedicated design lead who remains your single\n                            point of contact throughout.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-th-large fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Multi-Category Expertise</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">From luxury homes and villas to apartments, offices, and commercial spaces,\n                            our team designs across every category.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-file-invoice-dollar fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Honest, Transparent Pricing</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Detailed, itemised quotations with no hidden costs, so you always know what\n                            you are paying for.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-clipboard-check fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Rigorous Site Quality Checks</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Every stage of execution is inspected against our internal quality standards\n                            before work moves forward.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-handshake fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Long-Term Relationships</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Many of our clients return to us for future homes, offices, and referrals —\n                            our strongest measure of trust.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    }
